{"ticker":"TEL","updated":"2026-11-27T23:24:44Z","profile":{"longName":"TE Connectivity plc","shortName":"TE Connectivity plc","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.te.com","fullTimeEmployees":90000,"marketCap":62447931392,"trailingPE":19.676605,"forwardPE":14.436591,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.140454,"pegRatio":1.86,"targetMeanPrice":258.3684,"targetHighPrice":321.0,"targetLowPrice":225.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.119,"earningsGrowth":0.391,"grossMargins":0.35781,"operatingMargins":0.20332001,"profitMargins":0.16359,"totalRevenue":19885000704,"beta":1.153,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":252.56,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":190.27,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.48},"summary":"TE Connectivity plc, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells connectivity and sensor solutions in Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the AsiaPacific, and the Americas. The company operates through two reportable segments, Transportation Solutions and Industrial Solutions. It provides antennas, application tooling, cable assemblies, connectors, electromagnetic compatibility/electromagnetic interference solutions, energy and power, fiber optics, heat shrink tubing, identification and labeling, medical components, passive components, relays and contactors, sensors, switches, terminals and splices, wires and cables, and wire protection and management solutions. The company also offers training and other services, including 3D printing for production, back shells prototyping, electrical installation training, HarnWare software, machine tooling service and repair, medical device design services, microfluidic devices, and sensor manufacturing services as well as conducts automotive webinars. It serves 5G and wireless equipment, aerospace, appliances, automation and control, automotive, autosport, commercial and industrial vehicles, connected home, data centers and artificial intelligence, defense and military, energy solutions, e-mobility, industrial machinery, intelligent buildings, IoT connectivity, medical technologies, oil and gas/marine, personal electronics and wea","summary_zh":"TE Con​​nectivity plc 及其子公司在歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區和美洲製造和銷售連接和感測器解決方案。該公司透過兩個可報告部門運作：運輸解決方案部門和工業解決方案部門。它提供天線、應用工具、電纜組件、連接器、電磁相容性/電磁幹擾解決方案、能源和電力、光纖、熱縮管、識別和標籤、醫療元件、被動元件、繼電器和接觸器、感測器、開關、端子和接頭、電線和電纜以及電線保護和管理解決方案。該公司還提供培訓和其他服務，包括用於生產的 3D 列印、後殼原型製作、電氣安裝培訓、HarnWare 軟體、工具機加工服務和維修、醫療設備設計服務、微流體設備和感測器製造服務，並舉辦汽車網路研討會。它服務於5G和無線設備、航空航太、電器、自動化和控制、汽車、賽車、商業和工業車輛、互聯家居、資料中心和人工智慧、國防和軍事、能源解決方案、電動車、工業機械、智慧建築、物聯網連接、醫療技術、石油和天然氣/海洋、個人電子和Weather","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電子元件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":219.55,"h":219.75,"l":216.56,"c":217.78,"v":1181300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":217.78,"h":219.61,"l":217.2,"c":219.53,"v":1317800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":217.64,"h":222.01,"l":217.27,"c":221.69,"v":1613200},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":223.38,"h":223.75,"l":220.83,"c":221.11,"v":1213200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":221.17,"h":224.97,"l":220.73,"c":220.84,"v":1990700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":223.79,"h":225.26,"l":222.69,"c":222.96,"v":1694600},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":223.68,"h":224.64,"l":219.4,"c":222.07,"v":1256200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":223.3,"h":225.27,"l":221.08,"c":224.43,"v":1343400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":225.68,"h":226.4,"l":220.5,"c":222.46,"v":1293800},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":223.91,"h":224.25,"l":214.29,"c":214.57,"v":1153300},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":218.69,"h":220.18,"l":217.14,"c":219.38,"v":1477000},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":215.63,"h":222.12,"l":212.32,"c":220.65,"v":1318000},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":224.6,"h":226.1,"l":221.41,"c":222.69,"v":1306500},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":224.89,"h":226.5,"l":221.52,"c":224.19,"v":1139100},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":223.2,"h":224.53,"l":222.09,"c":222.98,"v":1343700},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":225.0,"h":226.96,"l":224.07,"c":225.96,"v":1799800},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":230.35,"h":234.5,"l":227.61,"c":228.22,"v":2851700},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":234.5,"h":237.5,"l"